# =====================================================================
# Ministry of Tribal Affairs (MoTA) Scholarship & Fellowship Portal
# Frontend Environment Configuration
# =====================================================================

# Backend API Base URL
#
# Production Mode (when Backend is deployed to a separate Vercel domain):
# Set this in your Vercel Project Environment Variables to your deployed backend URL:
# VITE_API_URL=https://<your-backend-project>.vercel.app/api
#
# Local Development & Unified Deployment:
# Uses Vite local proxy (defined in vite.config.js) or same-domain routing:
VITE_API_URL=/api
